msgctxt "120"
msgid "Hey, you wouldn't happen to be from around here, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Well... Actually, yeah. I guess I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Oh, wonderful. Then, would you happen to have seen this shisa statue? We've "
"been looking for the one in this photo for a while now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "A shisa statue... Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"You know, looks kinda like a cross between a lion and a dog?\r\n"
"Apparently, they're a big thing here. People put them by\r\n"
"their front door or on their roof to ward off evil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know what they are. But why do you need that particular one in the "
"photo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Long story short, we went here on our honeymoon last year and decided to "
"buy one as a souvenir. What we didn't realize at the time is that they "
"usually come in a pair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"We'd really like to complete the set, seeing as it\r\n"
"commemorates our wedding and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"But the shop where we bought our shisa last year went out of\r\n"
"business, and I don't know if they sell the kind we have\r\n"
"anywhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "I think I get the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"The one in the photo has its mouth open, but the one we're\r\n"
"looking for has its mouth closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "So you need a closed-mouth shisa, is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Exactly. One with an open mouth and one with a closed mouth.\r\n"
"That would give us a complete set."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I feel a little silly asking a total stranger, but if you\r\n"
"happen to see a shisa like this, would you let us know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Here, take this photo. If you find one, would you please\r\n"
"give us a call? Our phone number's on the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Shisa Photo<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. We'll make it worth your while if you find the\r\n"
"right one. Please and thank you!"
msgstr ""

